{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_walkway","model_identifier":"elf_walkway","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_walkway\n\nElf walkway segment: a raised wooden walkway on posts, 4 columns long along Z, deck 120 u up, curved rails built from stepped pale wood. Segments join end to end; slot_walk_a / slot_walk_b mark the joins.\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 4 columns (16 x 64 units, 0.45 x 1.80 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y 0..138, z -32..32 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 29, construction_0 6, construction_33 6, construction_66 19, ruined 7 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- deck: 16 x 4 x 64 at y 118..122 (walkable on top); posts 3 x 118 x 3\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `elf_walkway_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `elf_walkway_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_elf_walkway` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_walk_a` at (0, 122, -32)\n- `slot_walk_b` at (0, 122, 32)\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"deck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,118.0,-32.0],"to":[8.0,122.0,32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24.0,162.0,40.0,166.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,158.0,64.0,162.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24.0,162.0,40.0,166.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,158.0,64.0,162.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,32.0,64.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,32.0,64.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"18b67cad-f00f-5677-882a-0ba417b01599"},{"name":"post-28-1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.5,0.0,-29.5],"to":[-5.5,118.0,-26.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.5,0.0,3.5,118.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,7.5,118.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.5,0.0,3.5,118.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,7.5,118.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.5,166.5,3.5,169.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.5,166.5,3.5,169.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8267f234-716a-5241-b278-a764438b7dad"},{"name":"post-281","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[5.5,0.0,-29.5],"to":[8.5,118.0,-26.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.5,0.0,11.5,118.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,7.5,118.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.5,0.0,11.5,118.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,7.5,118.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.5,166.5,7.5,169.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.5,166.5,7.5,169.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5c7a3e40-afe7-5e76-a3e3-285ebb52d0fe"},{"name":"cross-28","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":fals